#: dorian_door/tutorial_dorian_trap/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Trap Dorian"
msgid "Love? What a gas."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/tutorial_dorian_trap/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Trap Dorian"
msgid "I believe everyone here should be friends."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/tutorial_dorian_trap/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Trap Dorian"
msgid "I'll believe it when I see it."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/tutorial_dorian_trap/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Trap Dorian"
msgid "You hear that?? Chaos Reborn?"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/tutorial_dorian_trap/0/c-3/7 dorian_door/tutorial_dorian_trap/0/g-0/131
msgctxt "Trap Dorian"
msgid "Human, you seem like a good sort. So we'll be friends, for now."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/tutorial_dorian_trap/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Trap Dorian"
msgid "We get a little knackered by using this newfangled dateviator rubbish, y'see."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/tutorial_dorian_trap/0/g-0/51
msgctxt "Trap Dorian"
msgid "But it's not necessarily the best of the options in my mind."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/tutorial_dorian_trap/0/g-0/67
msgctxt "Trap Dorian"
msgid "If everyone were friends, the world would be an awful lot safer in my opinion."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/tutorial_dorian_trap/0/g-0/75
msgctxt "Trap Dorian"
msgid "I've seen the complications of love. I've lived through the jealous quarrels of hate."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/tutorial_dorian_trap/0/g-0/83
msgctxt "Trap Dorian"
msgid "The true bond is one between two friends with none of those intricacies of romantic tension."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/tutorial_dorian_trap/0/g-0/91
msgctxt "Trap Dorian"
msgid "Having my shirt off here is strictly a professional choice."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/tutorial_dorian_trap/0/g-0/115
msgctxt "Trap Dorian"
msgid "You speakin' of Reggie?"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/tutorial_dorian_trap/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Trap Dorian"
msgid "You wear it well."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/tutorial_dorian_trap/0/g-1/19
msgctxt "Trap Dorian"
msgid "Duty calls, love."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/front_sorter/7
msgctxt "Tag Nom d'objet (MAJUSCULES)"
msgid "FRONT DOOR"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/front_first/0/12
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Dorian stands firmly in your way, an unmovable wall."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/front_first/0/20
msgctxt "Front Dorian"
msgid "Thinking of going outside?"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/front_first/0/28/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah, actually."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/front_first/0/29/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, just wanted to get to know you better."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/front_first/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Front Dorian"
msgid "All right."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/front_first/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Front Dorian"
msgid "It's a decision that takes a lot of thought, that."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/front_first/0/c-0/23
msgctxt "Front Dorian"
msgid "Just understand that when you do, events will sort of... coalesce... around a final decision."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/front_first/0/c-0/31
msgctxt "Front Dorian"
msgid "Think of it as making an irrevocable choice."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/front_first/0/c-0/39/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's pretty dramatic..."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/front_first/0/c-0/39/c-0/7
msgctxt "Front Dorian"
msgid "For this time, it is. Those dateviators have put you on a certain quest that I cannot advise you on."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/front_first/0/c-0/39/c-0/15
msgctxt "Front Dorian"
msgid "All I can do is let you know how important the choice of leaving this house is."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/front_first/0/c-0/39/c-0/23
msgctxt "Front Dorian"
msgid "Would you like to leave?"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/front_first/0/c-0/39/c-0/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/front_first/0/c-0/39/c-0/31/1/s/0 dorian_door/front_realized/0/23/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, I'll stay here."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/front_first/0/c-0/39/c-0/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "Front Dorian"
msgid "Right this way..."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/front_first/0/c-0/39/c-0/31/c-1/7 dorian_door/front_realized/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Front Dorian"
msgid "We'd love to have you."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/front_first/0/c-1/11
msgctxt "Front Dorian"
msgid "I'm a door who is the main entrance and egress from this domicile."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/front_first/0/c-1/19
msgctxt "Front Dorian"
msgid "I'm more impressive and ornate than the other doors because I need to project a welcoming presence."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/front_first/0/c-1/30
msgctxt "Front Dorian"
msgid "But also make it clear that those who do not deserve entry stay outside."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/front_first/0/c-1/38/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Anything else?"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/front_first/0/c-1/38/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You look great."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/front_first/0/c-1/38/c-0/7
msgctxt "Front Dorian"
msgid "I don't like music very much."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/front_first/0/c-1/38/c-0/19
msgctxt "Front Dorian"
msgid "...that's about it."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/front_first/0/c-1/38/c-1/7
msgctxt "Front Dorian"
msgid "Cheers."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/front_first/0/frontjoin/0
msgctxt "Front Dorian"
msgid "I open up when you tell me to. It's you who needs to make the decision about whether you're really ready to go out there."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/front_first/0/frontjoin/8
msgctxt "Front Dorian"
msgid "After all, you're the only one who knows the reason behind why you tend to stay inside these days."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/front_first/0/frontjoin/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's just really hard to get out these days."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/front_first/0/frontjoin/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It would be too expensive."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/front_first/0/frontjoin/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I just want to meet more dateables - and if I leave then the glasses might go away..."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/front_first/0/frontjoin/19/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I want to bring as many dateables to life as I can! David Most should not have these glasses."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/front_first/0/frontjoin/c-2/13
msgctxt "Front Dorian"
msgid "That's right. The very act of getting me to open up for you is too tough. Because why bother? Outside is chaotic, full of bonkers people."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/front_first/0/frontjoin/c-2/21
msgctxt "Front Dorian"
msgid "Inside I am your barricade against the elements and all the rest."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/front_first/0/frontjoin/c-3/13
msgctxt "Front Dorian"
msgid "Exactly. That would cost too much."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/front_first/0/frontjoin/c-3/21
msgctxt "Front Dorian"
msgid "Going outside exposes you to countless assets, all which need physics, collision, and sound."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/front_first/0/frontjoin/c-3/29
msgctxt "Front Dorian"
msgid "The cost to the average taxpayer is profound. Best to stay inside so that the Interactive Revenue Service can't find you."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/front_first/0/frontjoin/c-4/13 dorian_door/front_first/0/frontjoin/c-5/13
msgctxt "Front Dorian"
msgid "On the nose right there."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/front_first/0/frontjoin/c-4/21 dorian_door/front_first/0/frontjoin/c-5/21
msgctxt "Front Dorian"
msgid "You and me and the glasses can stay inside the confines of this house until you've done all you have."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/front_first/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Front Dorian"
msgid "So for now, I'll remind you to keep indoors. Stay safe."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/front_second/0/6
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Once again, Dorian stands in your way."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/front_second/0/14
msgctxt "Front Dorian"
msgid "Are you trying to leave again? Are you sure?"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/front_second/0/22/b/1
msgctxt "Front Dorian"
msgid "I'm looking out onto that street everyday and night. And it's still terrifying out there."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/front_second/0/22/b/9
msgctxt "Front Dorian"
msgid "The cars never stop driving..."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/front_second/0/25/b/1
msgctxt "Front Dorian"
msgid "Our budget couldn't possibly keep with the demands."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/front_second/0/28/b/1
msgctxt "Front Dorian"
msgid "There are still more conversations to be had with all of us."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/front_second/0/31/b/1
msgctxt "Front Dorian"
msgid "There are still more of us to be Realized."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/front_second/0/34/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, I'm ready to go."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/front_second/0/35/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I was just saying hello."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/front_second/0/36/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're right, I'll just stay inside for a while longer."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/front_second/0/37/s/0 dorian_door/front_realized/0/24/s/0 dorian_door/office_closet_second/0/19/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Actually, I was thinking of having you join them out there!"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/front_second/0/c-0/7 dorian_door/front_third/0/c-0/15 dorian_door/front_realized/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The front door opens... rather dramatically."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/front_second/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Front Dorian"
msgid "Ah, thinking of getting to know me better?"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/front_second/0/c-1/15/b/1
msgctxt "Front Dorian"
msgid "As if I would have more to say than last time?"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/front_second/0/c-1/18
msgctxt "Front Dorian"
msgid "I would suggest speaking with my other forms around the house."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/front_second/0/c-1/26
msgctxt "Front Dorian"
msgid "I am always on task here at the front. Strictly business."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/front_second/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Front Dorian"
msgid "It's just plain good advice, that."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/front_third/0/8
msgctxt "Front Dorian"
msgid "I've said my piece. In, or out?"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/front_third/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Out!"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/front_third/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'll stay here."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/front_third/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Front Dorian"
msgid "Your wish is my command..."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/front_third/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Front Dorian"
msgid "Glad we had this chat."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/front_realized/0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Dorian stands in your way just as he always does... but there's something less firm about his posture today."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/front_realized/0/8/b/1
msgctxt "Front Dorian"
msgid "Well, you've brought one of us to life, and have good reason to leave the house to see them."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/front_realized/0/11/b/1
msgctxt "Front Dorian"
msgid "Well, you've brought some of us to life, and have good reason to leave the house to see them."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/front_realized/0/14
msgctxt "Front Dorian"
msgid "Is this it, then? To see what awaits?"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/front_realized/0/22/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm ready to go see my new friends!"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/front_realized/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Dorian gives you a subtle but reassuring smile."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/office_sorter/7
msgctxt "Tag Nom d'objet (MAJUSCULES)"
msgid "OFFICE DOOR"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/office_first/0/12
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Dorian looms over you, just as intimidating as ever."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/office_first/0/17
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Fancy a bit of a work?"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/office_first/0/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I beg your pardon?"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/office_first/0/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I guess so!"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/office_first/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Because... this leads to the office?"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/office_first/0/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ooh! What's in there?"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/office_first/0/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I knew that. I live here."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/office_first/0/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Suppose I could tell you a bit about the inhabitants. Let's see..."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/office_first/0/c-0/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Course you do, love."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/office_first/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "We've got some important denizens who only reside here. All in all, fairly quiet."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/office_first/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "It's packed in there, but here are a few off the top of my frame:"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/office_first/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "There's Shelley the Shelf, Chance the trusty d20, Penelope the Office Supplies, and Jerry the Junk Drawer."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/office_first/0/g-0/24 dorian_door/laundry_closet_first/0/g-1/c-4/7 dorian_door/laundry_closet_second/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Well..."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/office_explain_1/0/8/0 dorian_door/bathroom_1_first/0/bathroomhints/0 dorian_door/bathroom_second_explain/0/0 dorian_door/gym_hall_first/0/gymexplainjoin/0 dorian_door/bedroom_first/0/g-0/9/0 dorian_door/bedroom_third/0/16 dorian_door/attic_hints_dorian/0/0
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "What can I do for you?"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/office_explain_1/0/8/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Can you tell me anything about Shelley?"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/office_explain_1/0/8/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What do you know about Chance?"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/office_explain_1/0/8/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Is the joke here that Penelope starts with Pen?"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/office_explain_1/0/8/11/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Jerry sounds interesting!"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/office_explain_1/0/8/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "She's supportive."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/office_explain_1/0/8/c-0/18/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's it?"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/office_explain_1/0/8/c-0/18/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Alright! I think I'll go say hello."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/office_explain_1/0/8/c-0/18/2/s/0 dorian_door/office_explain_1/0/8/c-1/40/1/s/0 dorian_door/office_explain_1/0/8/c-2/59/1/s/0 dorian_door/office_explain_1/0/8/c-3/43/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What about the others?"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/office_explain_1/0/8/c-0/18/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "It's true. What more do you want?"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/office_explain_1/0/8/c-0/18/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Any secrets about how to get her to like me?"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/office_explain_1/0/8/c-0/18/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I guess that's enough to go on..."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/office_explain_1/0/8/c-0/18/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Be supportive."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/office_explain_1/0/8/c-0/18/c-1/7 dorian_door/office_explain_1/0/8/c-3/43/c-1/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Entrez-vous, as they say on the continent!"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/office_explain_1/0/8/c-1/13
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Grottos and Gargoyles is his game of choice. He has tons of stories he wants to tell, but hasn’t found the person he wants to tell them with. As such, he creates scenarios to test the abilities."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/office_explain_1/0/8/c-1/24
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Given the amount of time that he spends creating these worlds, he takes them very seriously."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/office_explain_1/0/8/c-1/32
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "If you're looking to be his friend, you should play through one of his campaigns."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/office_explain_1/0/8/c-1/40/0/s/0 dorian_door/office_explain_1/0/8/c-3/43/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Alright! Let's get in there and meet him!"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/office_explain_1/0/8/c-1/40/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "After you."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/office_explain_1/0/8/c-2/13
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Ah yeah, I see."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/office_explain_1/0/8/c-2/21
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "You think our names are funny."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/office_explain_1/0/8/c-2/29
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "I'll have you know that my name is Dorian after the Grecian column, as I am strong and sparse in decoration."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/office_explain_1/0/8/c-2/48
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "But yes, her name does start with Pen which is certainly what she is."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/office_explain_1/0/8/c-2/59/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Alright! Let's get in there and meet her!"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/office_explain_1/0/8/c-2/59/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "After you!"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/office_explain_1/0/8/c-3/13
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Jerry means well, but his tendencies to keep any old thing around get on the nerves of our good mayor Celia."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/office_explain_1/0/8/c-3/27
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "You'll eventually have to find a way to deal with it if you are looking to become his friend."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/office_explain_1/0/8/c-3/35
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "My recommendation? One man's junk can be another man's artt."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/office_explain_1/0/8/c-3/43/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You spelled 'art' with two 't's?"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/office_explain_1/0/8/c-3/43/3/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh funny spelling, like Artt!"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/office_explain_1/0/8/c-3/43/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Oh, you haven't met him, have you?"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/office_explain_1/0/8/c-3/43/c-0/15
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Take a look at an empty frame. You might be surprised by what you find."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/dorian_office_explain_done/0
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "That's your lot for now. If you want to know more, you'll have to see for yourself."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/office_second/0/6
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "You're back. On your quest for friendship, I trust."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/office_second/0/14
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Say, have you met Wilhemina?"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/office_second/0/22/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I have actually!"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/office_second/0/23/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I haven't yet."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/office_second/0/24/s/0 dorian_door/office_closet_third/0/5/s/0 dorian_door/bathroom_1_second/0/g-0/14/s/0 dorian_door/bathroom_bedroom_second/0/16/s/0 dorian_door/bedroom_closet_no_clothes_2/0/18/s/0 dorian_door/bedroom_closet_toxic_2/0/24/s/0 dorian_door/bedroom_closet_healthy_2/0/16/s/0 dorian_door/laundry_closet_second/0/g-0/18/s/0 dorian_door/trap_second/0/g-0/37/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Actually, I was thinking of Realizing you!"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/office_second/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Ah brill, mate. She can be hard to find!"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/office_second/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Just wanted to make sure the friendship was spreading."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/office_second/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Ah! She can be tricky to find. Her full name is Wilhemina Work, and she is your job."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/office_second/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Or, was your job. Till you biffed it."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/office_second/0/c-1/23
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "If you want to speak to her, just fire up a charge while on your workspace."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/office_second/0/c-1/34
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "She's a gem, trust me. Great friend, that one. I enjoy my job as much as the next."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/office_third/0/0
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Back once more at the office, eh? I've told you quite a bit by this point."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/office_third/0/8
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "I shouldn't be your focus here. Go make some friends!"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/office_third/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "On it."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/office_third/0/17/s/0 dorian_door/gym_hall_third/0/17/s/0 dorian_door/gym_closet_third/0/17/s/0 dorian_door/electric_third/0/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Actually, would you like to be Realized?"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/office_closet_sorter/7
msgctxt "Tag Nom d'objet (MAJUSCULES)"
msgid "OFFICE CLOSET DOOR"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/office_closet_first/0/12
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Dorian stands in your way, but he seems oddly contemplative here."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/office_closet_first/0/20
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Ah... one of my closest friends, the closet. A space for imaginings, longings, and being trapped in eternal darkness."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/office_closet_first/0/28
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Here you'll find the water heater, some boxes, and... I s'pose that's about it."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/office_closet_first/0/36
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Do you want to know something interesting about closets?"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/office_closet_first/0/44/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sure."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/office_closet_first/0/45/s/0 dorian_door/bathroom_1_second/0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, I'm okay."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/office_closet_first/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "So would I."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/office_closet_first/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "So am I."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/office_closet_second/0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Dorian seems surprised to see you here again."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/office_closet_second/0/8
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "You're back? I imagine by this time you've met Winnifred, and Beau..."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/office_closet_second/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh, not Winnifred yet!"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/office_closet_second/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I didn't get around to Beau yet..."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/office_closet_second/0/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yup."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/office_closet_second/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Well let's not wait for the grass to grow, get a move on! She's the hot one in the corner."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/office_closet_second/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Keep your eyes peeled for any boxes and you'll see her soon!"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/office_closet_second/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Hm."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/office_closet_second/0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Well, I s'pose perhaps you deserve a little more of a tip, eh? You've been so hard at work finding everyone."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/office_closet_second/0/c-2/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I know about Trap Dorian already."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/office_closet_second/0/c-2/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Gimme a hint, Dorian!"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/office_closet_second/0/c-2/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "You found him! I was under NDA!"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/office_closet_second/0/c-2/23/c-0/18
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "No Doors Announced!"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/office_closet_second/0/c-2/23/c-0/26
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Well then, I really have no more here to offer you - cagey hints begone."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/office_closet_second/0/c-2/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "All right... maybe you should know... there's another Dorian very close by."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/office_closet_second/0/c-2/23/c-1/15
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Take a close look around... search high and low..."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/office_closet_third/0/0/b/1
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Well done, you saucy stevedore. I hope you enjoyed my little trap."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/office_closet_third/0/1/b/1
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Remember... somewhere around there's a door to be found..."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/office_closet_third/0/4/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Thank you..."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_1_sorter/7
msgctxt "Tag Nom d'objet (MAJUSCULES)"
msgid "BATHROOM DOOR"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_1_first/0/12
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Dorian is as tall as ever, but there's something off with his energy today. His eyes dart briefly from side to side, as though ensuring you're alone."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_1_first/0/20
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Welcome to the lavatory. Let's keep things private here."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_1_first/0/28
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Very... hush hush."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_1_first/0/36/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Dorian... are you embarrassed?"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_1_first/0/37/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Understood."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_1_first/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "...maybe a little."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_1_first/0/c-0/18
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Let's move on."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_1_first/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Try as I might to keep things quiet nestled in this lovely little space in the house..."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_1_first/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "We seem to have attracted our loudest members."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_1_first/0/g-0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Actually, I'm suddenly not interested."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_1_first/0/g-0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Who is here?"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_1_first/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "I'm suddenly leaving this conversation."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_1_first/0/bathroomhints/9/0
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "We have a rapping loo, a singing shower, and a sink screaming about his very existence!"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_1_first/0/bathroomhints/9/8/b/1
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "The neighbors have even filed noise complaints... though not even about those three. It's about the bloody smoke alarm!"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_1_first/0/bathroomhints/9/11/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Tell me about the 'loo'."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_1_first/0/bathroomhints/9/11/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Tell me about the shower."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_1_first/0/bathroomhints/9/11/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Tell me about the sink."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_1_first/0/bathroomhints/9/11/3/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I know what you mean... I've met them all."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_1_first/0/bathroomhints/9/11/4/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I've heard enough about this particular room."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_1_first/0/bathroomhints/9/11/c-4/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Jean Loo Pissoir - or better known by his stage name... ugh... \"Little Crapper\", is a highly talented though repulsive member of this little tribe."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_1_first/0/bathroomhints/9/11/c-4/21/b/1
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "I told you I don't like music."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_1_first/0/bathroomhints/9/11/c-4/24/b/1
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "I don't like music very much."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_1_first/0/bathroomhints/9/11/c-5/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Johnny Splash thinks he's a singer."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_1_first/0/bathroomhints/9/11/c-5/15
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "He's a shower."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_1_first/0/bathroomhints/9/11/c-6/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "He's a sink, right?"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_1_first/0/bathroomhints/9/11/c-6/18
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Thinks he isn't though."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_1_first/0/bathroomhints/9/11/c-6/26
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "I'm a door."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_1_first/0/bathroomhints/9/11/c-6/34
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Always have been."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_1_first/0/bathroomhints/9/11/c-6/42
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "My mental faculties are <i>perfect</i>."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_1_first/0/bathroomhints/9/11/c-7/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Pity."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_1_first/0/bathroomhints/9/11/c-8/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "You're lucky you can leave..."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_1_second/0/6
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Perhaps you've come here to do your necessaries. But I should ask..."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_1_second/0/14
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Are you injured?"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_1_second/0/22/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Only a broken heart."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_1_second/0/23/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "SPLINTER"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_1_second/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Love will do that to ya. Don't recommend it."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_1_second/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "If you are injured in body - you can meet Farya, our first-aid kit."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_1_second/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Right!"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_1_second/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Farya can help you there - she's the first-aid kit."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_1_second/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Still. Good to know when you need first-aid."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_1_second/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "You can find her here under the sink - one of our more 'out-of-the-way' dateables."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_1_second/0/g-0/11/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sounds good, thanks for the tip."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_1_second/0/g-0/12/s/0 dorian_door/bedroom_second/0/15/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't care."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_1_second/0/g-0/13/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh I've met her - thanks for the tip though!"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_1_second/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Health is always important."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_1_second/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Bully for you."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_1_second/0/g-0/c-5/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "My pleasure."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_1_third/0/0
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "All right, all right... what brings you here again?"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_1_third/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wee wee!"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_1_third/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Doo doo!"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_1_third/0/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wee wee doo doo pee pee poo poo!"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_1_third/0/11/s/0 dorian_door/back_third/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Actually, I'm thinking about getting you Realized!"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_1_third/0/12/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh, just saying hello."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_1_third/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Captivating."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_1_third/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Appalling."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_1_third/0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "After you..."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_1_third/0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "We can do that elsewhere."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_bedroom_sorter/7
msgctxt "Tag Nom d'objet (MAJUSCULES)"
msgid "BEDROOM/BATHROOM DOOR"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_bedroom_first/0/6
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Dorian for once does not stand in your way—perhaps even he knows there's no sense in blocking bathroom access."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_bedroom_first/0/28 dorian_door/gym_bathroom_first/0/28
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "The first floor bathroom... One of the more relaxing places if I do say so myself."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_bedroom_first/0/40/s/0 dorian_door/gym_bathroom_first/0/40/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "First floor? That's downstairs."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_bedroom_first/0/41/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "This is where my bathtub is."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_bedroom_first/0/c-0/7 dorian_door/gym_bathroom_first/0/c-0/11 dorian_door/ff_door_checkout/0/8
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Oh you yanks are all the same."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_bedroom_first/0/c-0/15 dorian_door/gym_bathroom_first/0/c-0/19 dorian_door/gym_bathroom_first/0/g-0/1/c-3/15
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "This is the first floor, the premier étage."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_bedroom_first/0/c-0/23 dorian_door/gym_bathroom_first/0/c-0/27 dorian_door/gym_bathroom_first/0/g-0/1/c-3/23 dorian_door/ff_door_checkout/0/78
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Downstairs is the GROUND floor. Because it's on the ground."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_bedroom_first/0/c-0/31/0/s/0 dorian_door/gym_bathroom_first/0/c-0/35/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh, that does make sense."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_bedroom_first/0/c-0/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Course it does. Everything that exists states-side is better thought out where I came from."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_bedroom_first/0/c-1/7 dorian_door/bathroom_second_explain/0/c-2/18/c-1/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Spot on."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_bedroom_first/0/first_floor_join/0
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "In here resides Barry Styles your Beauty Supplies, Amir the Mirror, and Rebel the Rubber Ducky."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_second_explain/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Tell me about Barry."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_second_explain/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Tell me about Amir."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_second_explain/0/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Tell me about Rebel."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_second_explain/0/11/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I've heard enough."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_second_explain/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Barry is a great bloke. Always happy to lend a hand however he can."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_second_explain/0/c-0/18
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Careful, though: he might be fragile on the inside and not show his hand."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_second_explain/0/c-0/26
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "You might not know where you stand with him until it's too late."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_second_explain/0/c-0/34/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What do you mean, I should be careful?"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_second_explain/0/c-0/34/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sounds like he's weak."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_second_explain/0/c-0/34/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Barry has problems with his memory - and while he may put a smiling face on it, he does need to have a welcoming ear from time to time."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_second_explain/0/c-0/34/c-1/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Sounds like you want this to be difficult."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_second_explain/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "He'll reflect back on you what you want to hear, or at least, what he thinks you want to hear."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_second_explain/0/c-1/18
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "He's handsome enough, sure, and sometimes he believes that looks are all that matter."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_second_explain/0/c-1/26
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "For me, in my position, I can already see 5 of me, not counting the reflection in the mirror."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_second_explain/0/c-1/34
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "That's more than enough self-reflection for this door."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_second_explain/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "They are... rowdy."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_second_explain/0/c-2/18/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Okay... sounds kind of fun."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_second_explain/0/c-2/18/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You seem to use understatement a great deal."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_second_explain/0/c-2/18/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Just make sure that there are no adults peeking over your shoulder when you talk to them."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_second_explain/0/c-2/18/c-1/7 dorian_door/laundry_second/0/c-0/7 dorian_door/laundry_third/0/c-2/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Precisely."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_second_explain/0/c-2/18/c-1/15
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "They are... three degrees more rowdy than rowdy."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_second_explain/0/c-2/18/c-1/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "So five degrees?"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_second_explain/0/c-2/18/c-1/23/c-0/15
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Might want to turn on Skylar's Content Aware feature if you have concerns."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_second_explain/0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "I've said enough."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_bedroom_second/0/6
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "It's funny, from here I have a better view of you while you sleep than the actual bedroom door."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_bedroom_second/0/14/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh?"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_bedroom_second/0/15/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Creepy."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_bedroom_second/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "While you rest - I find myself at peace. It's the time when I can see my human least likely to get themselves into trouble."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_bedroom_second/0/c-0/15/0/s/0 dorian_door/bathroom_bedroom_third/0/27/s/0 dorian_door/gym_closet_second/0/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Thanks, Dorian."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_bedroom_second/0/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Actually, I have nightmares sometimes."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_bedroom_second/0/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "You are welcome."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_bedroom_second/0/c-0/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "You... have intruders? In your mind?"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_bedroom_second/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's right."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_bedroom_second/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "My apologies."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_bedroom_second/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "I will do my best to keep them away."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_bedroom_second/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/26/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Actually, I love Nightmare."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_bedroom_second/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/26/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You do that, Dorian."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_bedroom_second/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/26/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Actually, we're friends!"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_bedroom_second/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/26/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Love... Intruders... You??"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_bedroom_second/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/26/c-0/15
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "I..."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_bedroom_second/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/26/c-0/23
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "I need a moment to let that sink in."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_bedroom_second/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/26/c-2/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Friends!"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_bedroom_second/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/26/c-2/15
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Well why didn't you say so."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_bedroom_second/0/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-0/26/c-2/23
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Friends are the best kind of intruders."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_bedroom_second/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Not 'creepy'. I am here to stand guard, nothing more."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_bedroom_second/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "I'm not looking for anything salacious. On the contrary."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bathroom_bedroom_second/0/c-1/23 dorian_door/gym_closet_first/0/g-0/c-3/39 dorian_door/electric_second/0/c-1/50/c-1/15/c-0/23 dorian_door/electric_second/0/c-1/50/c-1/15/c-1/7 dorian_door/bedroom_second/0/c-0/31/g-0/0/c-0/34 dorian_door/laundry_second/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Goodbye."
