#: dorian_door/gym_hall_sorter/7
msgctxt "Tag Nom d'objet (MAJUSCULES)"
msgid "GYM DOOR"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_hall_first/0/12
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "The gymnasium."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_hall_first/0/20
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Do you enjoy coming here?"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_hall_first/0/28/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I do."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_hall_first/0/29/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't..."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_hall_first/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "I always am eager to see you strengthen yourself."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_hall_first/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "It is all right. Honesty is always my favorite path."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_hall_first/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "If you're looking to meet some new faces, I could tell you about them."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_hall_first/0/g-0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, just passing through."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_hall_first/0/g-0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sure, who is here?"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_hall_first/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Onward and forward."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_hall_first/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "You'll find Stepford, Kristof, and Dunk more than anyone here."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_hall_first/0/gymexplainjoin/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Tell me about Stepford."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_hall_first/0/gymexplainjoin/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Tell me about Kristof."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_hall_first/0/gymexplainjoin/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Tell me about Dunk."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_hall_first/0/gymexplainjoin/11/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh, I've met them all."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_hall_first/0/gymexplainjoin/12/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Okay, I've heard enough. See you around."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_hall_first/0/gymexplainjoin/c-4/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Stepford is quite good-looking - though some say he's lost his shine over the years."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_hall_first/0/gymexplainjoin/c-4/15
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "You'll find him among your trophies and awards."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_hall_first/0/gymexplainjoin/c-5/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "The Norwegian crosstrainer lies in the corner - quite large and intimidating."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_hall_first/0/gymexplainjoin/c-5/18
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "A violent sort, I would normally be on my guard, two sandwiches short of a picnic if you ask me. Though he is as immobile as I am."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_hall_first/0/gymexplainjoin/c-5/26
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Predictable too."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_hall_first/0/gymexplainjoin/c-6/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Dunk Shuttlecock is scattered all around - the sporting goods that you might use if you fancy some body improvement."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_hall_first/0/gymexplainjoin/c-6/18/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "His name is 'Dunk Shuttlecock'?"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_hall_first/0/gymexplainjoin/c-6/18/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Okay - I'll go check him out."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_hall_first/0/gymexplainjoin/c-6/18/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Yes."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_hall_first/0/gymexplainjoin/c-6/18/c-1/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "He would... probably enjoy that very much."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_hall_first/0/gymexplainjoin/c-7/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Then I am no help to you here, I reckon."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_hall_first/0/gymexplainjoin/c-7/15 dorian_door/gym_hall_third/0/c-0/7 dorian_door/ff_door_checkout/0/c-0/15 dorian_door/bedroom_second/0/c-1/7 dorian_door/bedroom_closet_third/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Carry on."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_hall_first/0/gymexplainjoin/c-8/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Ta."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_hall_second/0/6
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Each door is a passageway between two rooms."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_hall_second/0/14
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "I might think of myself primarily as a 'gym door', but I am also the 'landing door'."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_hall_second/0/22/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Fascinating."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_hall_second/0/23/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I think of you as a 'gym door'."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_hall_second/0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Who cares?"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_hall_second/0/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Actually, the only thing I think you should be called is 'human'!"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_hall_second/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "How many names do you have?"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_hall_second/0/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "One, I think?"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_hall_second/0/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "A first and last name."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_hall_second/0/c-0/15/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Thousands - I am manifold."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_hall_second/0/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "I s'pose I have one as well - Dorian."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_hall_second/0/c-0/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "It's an alright sort of name."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_hall_second/0/c-0/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Used for different reasons, different purposes."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_hall_second/0/c-0/15/c-1/15
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Subject to change as my name changes based on my locale..."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_hall_second/0/c-0/15/c-2/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Incredible. I'm impressed."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_hall_second/0/c-0/15/g-0/0
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Duty calls."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_hall_second/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "The whims of the limited mind."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_hall_second/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "While standing here, I have an awful lot of time to ruminate."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_hall_second/0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "You clearly have better things to do."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_hall_third/0/0
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "I think of myself as the Landing Door more often than not these days."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_hall_third/0/8
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Anything you need?"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_hall_third/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, just passing by, Landing Dorian."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_bathroom_sorter/7
msgctxt "Tag Nom d'objet (MAJUSCULES)"
msgid "GYM/BATHROOM DOOR"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_bathroom_first/0/20
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Dorian doesn't stand in your way here, gesturing to the bathroom."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_bathroom_first/0/41/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I do like it when it gets a little steamy in here."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_bathroom_first/0/c-0/35/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Course it does. Everything that exists stateside is better thought out where I come from."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_bathroom_first/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Careful now."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_bathroom_first/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Any more mention of 'steam' and it might appear I might have a flirt on my knobs."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_bathroom_first/0/c-1/23
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "And I'm not too keen on any of that messy 'love' 'round these halls."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_bathroom_first/0/c-1/31/b/1
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Present company excepted."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_bathroom_first/0/c-1/34/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm not sorry, Dorian. I'm looking for love."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_bathroom_first/0/c-1/34/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're right - I do enjoy making friends."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_bathroom_first/0/c-1/34/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It'll be our little secret."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_bathroom_first/0/c-1/34/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Tch."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_bathroom_first/0/c-1/34/c-1/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Right you do."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_bathroom_first/0/c-1/34/c-2/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Wink wink, nudge nudge."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_bathroom_first/0/g-0/1/0
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "I am the single path from the gymnasium to the first floor bathroom."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_bathroom_first/0/g-0/1/8
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Without me here, I could see you drenched in sweat after a workout, pathetically wandering from no less than two other rooms and doors until at last you are surrounded by the welcoming sight of the washroom."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_bathroom_first/0/g-0/1/16
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Imagine the shame as your unwashed form slithers across the second floor landing, witnessed by all the other objects - gazing at you from lidless eyes."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_bathroom_first/0/g-0/1/24
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Where would you be without one such as me?"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_bathroom_first/0/g-0/1/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's very helpful, Dorian."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_bathroom_first/0/g-0/1/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Though you really are the second floor bathroom door."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_bathroom_first/0/g-0/1/c-2/7/b/1
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "I am nothing but at your service, sir."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_bathroom_first/0/g-0/1/c-2/8/b/1
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "I am nothing but at your service, madame."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_bathroom_first/0/g-0/1/c-2/9/b/1
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "I am nothing but at your service."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/ff_door_checkout/0/0
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "You're trying to pull one over on me, eh?"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/ff_door_checkout/0/16
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Taking the mickey at old Dorian and his strange ways."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/ff_door_checkout/0/27
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Well I will have a laugh at you."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/ff_door_checkout/0/35
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Dorian closes his eyes, a look of immense concentration on his face. When he opens his eyes again, his expression is downright devilish."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/ff_door_checkout/0/51
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He takes a deep breath, and then..."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/ff_door_checkout/0/59
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Heh."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/ff_door_checkout/0/70
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "See how it feels, human?"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/ff_door_checkout/0/86/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Okay, I'm sorry. You're right, Dorian."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/ff_door_checkout/0/87/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Kinda confusing to me."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/ff_door_checkout/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "All right angles on this portal."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/ff_door_checkout/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Oh, did I count too high for your minute mainland mind?"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/ff_door_checkout/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "My apologies - I will endeavour to count no higher than one for you from now on."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_bathroom_second/0/9
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "You know, this is the only room in the house where there are two of me staring at each other... standing guard."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_bathroom_second/0/17
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Pretty neat, eh?"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_bathroom_second/0/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah, sure."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_bathroom_second/0/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "So?"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_bathroom_second/0/27/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What's even neater is Realizing you..."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_bathroom_second/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "I think it's neat."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_bathroom_second/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "So, it must mean that this is the most important room in the house?"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_bathroom_second/0/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I guess so."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_bathroom_second/0/c-1/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't think that follows..."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_bathroom_second/0/c-1/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "I was hoping you wouldn't agree."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_bathroom_second/0/c-1/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Correct. Well done."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_bathroom_second/0/c-1/15/g-0/0
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "There is no room in this house more important than any other."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_bathroom_second/0/c-1/15/g-0/8
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Each has its function, its residents, and particular odor."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_bathroom_second/0/c-1/15/g-0/16
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Although, I suppose this one has a rather <i>particular</i> odor."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_bathroom_third/0/0
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "You chose to speak to me?"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_bathroom_third/0/8/b/1
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "I love it when you do."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_bathroom_third/0/11
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "You must be very specifically on your way from the gymnasium to this washroom."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_bathroom_third/0/19
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Thank you for using me for this purpose."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_bathroom_third/0/27/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Never change, Dorian."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_bathroom_third/0/28/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm ready to Realize you, Dorian."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_bathroom_third/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "I am incapable of change."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_closet_sorter/7
msgctxt "Tag Nom d'objet (MAJUSCULES)"
msgid "GYM CLOSET DOOR"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_closet_first/0/12
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Would you like to go for a walk?"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_closet_first/0/20/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Because you're a 'walk-in' closet?"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_closet_first/0/21/s/0 dorian_door/laundry_second/0/23/s/0 dorian_door/iron_first/0/understand/28/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_closet_first/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "You catch my meaning well."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_closet_first/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "But I'm a 'walk-in' closet."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_closet_first/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "You could do all sorts of things inside me here. Practically my own little room."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_closet_first/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Spread your arms this way and that, jump up and down, sit and have a spot of tea."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_closet_first/0/g-0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I can't do any of those things."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_closet_first/0/g-0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sounds like fun!"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_closet_first/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "I've noticed you've been more static in your movements lately. Very uncreative."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_closet_first/0/g-0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "I bet you can't even sit in a chair, can you?"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_closet_first/0/g-0/c-2/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's right, I can't. It just kinda 'wiggles'."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_closet_first/0/g-0/c-2/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Madness."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_closet_first/0/g-0/c-2/23/c-0/15
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "It's all the phones these days if you ask me."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_closet_first/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Oh it's right fun, innit?"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_closet_first/0/g-0/c-3/15
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "I've been thinking of upgrading this to a real 'room' in the house."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_closet_first/0/g-0/c-3/23
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "But I don't have the proper permits."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_closet_first/0/g-0/c-3/31
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Also I'm a door."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_closet_second/0/9
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "These doors here are of the 'sliding' variety."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_closet_second/0/17
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Rather than swing in and out, I glide across myself horizontally, never touching."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_closet_second/0/25
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "You may try to have both sides of me open at the same time, but let me be the first to say that it is physically and spatially impossible."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_closet_second/0/34/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah, I know what sliding doors are."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_closet_second/0/35/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "But what about Realizing you? Is that possible?"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_closet_second/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Always happy to help."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_closet_second/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "What the fuck else d'ya want me to talk about?"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_closet_second/0/c-1/21/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Do you love me?"
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_closet_second/0/c-1/21/c-0/7/b/1
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Course I do."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_closet_second/0/c-1/21/c-0/10/b/1 dorian_door/bedroom_third/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "No."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_closet_second/0/c-1/21/c-0/13
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "I do one thing, I do it well."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_closet_second/0/c-1/21/c-0/21
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Of anything else, I cannot tell."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_closet_second/0/c-1/21/c-0/37
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Aw shite. That rhymed."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/gym_closet_third/0/0
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Found yourself wondering more about this closet?"
msgstr ""

