#: dorian_door/bedroom_closet_healthy/0/22
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Thank you for doing that."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bedroom_closet_healthy/0/33
msgctxt "Dorian"
msgid "Separation is usually what is best for us all."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/bedroom_closet_healthy/0/41/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It just seemed like the right thing to do."
