#: dorian_door/dorian_love_divert/30
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Dorian may insist he keeps things professional, but he takes to lovemaking with a shocking passion. Gone is the immovable, stone-faced door who once guarded the rooms of your house—there's only a warm and generous lover left in his stead."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/dorian_love_divert/38
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Dorian is attentive and courteous, putting his considerable strength into ensuring your every desire is fulfilled. When he departs the next morning there's an echo of his old self in the stoic expression he wears, but when he kisses your forehead he's just as gentle and sweet as he'd been the night before."
msgstr ""

#: dorian_door/dorian_love_join/0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Dorian places his hands on the front door frame as he looks back into your house one last time."
